---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/index.css';
import '../styles/components/header.css';
---
<html lang="zh-Hant">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>TVBS TECH</title>
        <meta name="keywords" content="">
        <meta name="description" content="">
        <meta property="og:title" content="">
        <meta property="og:image" content="">
        <link rel="icon" href="" type="image/icon">
    </head>
    <body>
        <h1 style="display: none;">TVBS TECH</h1>
        <header>
            <nav>
                <div class="frameBox">
                    <div class="navBox">
                        <div class="logo">
                            <img width="164" height="24" src="/tvbs-logo.svg" alt="logo" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="menu">
                            <a href="#">頭條</a>
                            <a href="#">最新</a>
                            <a href="#">專題</a>
                            <a href="#">影音</a>
                            <a href="#">財經</a>
                            <a href="#">專欄</a>
                            <a href="#">出版</a>
                            <a href="#">合作</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="switch">
                            <span>Classic</span>
                            <label class="btn">
                                <input type="checkbox" id="viewSwitch" />
                                <span class="slider"></span>
                            </label>
                            <span>Story</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </header>
        <main>
            <section>                
                <div class="frameBox">
                    <div id="hero">
                        <div class="kv">
                            <div class="box">
                                <div class="img">
                                    <img width="1440" height="400" src="/main-view-01.jpg" alt="kv" />
                                </div>
                                <div class="txtBox">
                                    <div class="inBox">
                                        <div class="itemTitle">
                                            <p>科技頭條</p>
                                            <p>MUST-READ</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="newsBox">
                                            <div class="title">
                                                台積電晶片產能吃緊！日經爆：超微、Google轉求三星
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="description">
                                                AI 基礎設施需求飆升，台積電先進製程供不應求，比亞迪、Google、超微、特斯拉日益傾向尋求三星代工——一場牽動全球供應鏈的產能挪移正在發生。
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="more">
                                                <a href="#">
                                                    <span>閱讀完整報導</span>
                                                    <div class="arraw">
                                                        <img width="28" height="28" src="/arraw-right-01.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                                    </div>
                                                </a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="newslist">
                            <div class="inBox">
                                <ul>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-01.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    三星全球導入ChatGPT與Codex　OpenAI拿下最大企業部署案之一
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-02.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    Q1全球半導體營收達3190億美元 季增27%創新高 記憶體翻倍成主力
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-03.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    護國神山太狂！德國廠外溢效應　薩克森各縣市爭取與台合作
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-04.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    AI時代不缺聰明人！黃仁勳曝輝達徵才標準：1特質一定成功
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-05.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    跟台積電完成簽約！擴廠落腳「南科特定區A區」
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <a href="#">
                                            <div class="date">2026/06/22</div>
                                            <div class="news">
                                                <div class="img">
                                                    <img width="96" height="54" src="/news-image-06.jpg" alt="arraw" loading="lazy" />
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="title">
                                                    台積電發威！美廠第1季暴賺188億　一季賺贏去年全年
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="arraw">
                                                <img width="24" height="24 " src="/arraw-right-02.svg" alt="arraw" />
                                            </div>
                                        </a>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <div class="frameBox">
                    <div id="new">
                         <div class="inBox">

                            <div class="flex">
                                <div class="titleBox">
                                    <div class="itemTitle">
                                        <p>最新科技情報</p>
                                        <p>TECH SIGNALS</p>
                                    </div>    
                                    <div class="title">
                                        讀懂<span>趨勢</span><br>
                                        再<span>行動</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>                            
                                <div class="list">
                                    <div class="item">
                                        <div class="img">
                                            <img width="600" height="342 " src="/news-image-07.jpg" alt="img" />
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="txtBox">
                                            <div class="title">
                                                三星全球導入 ChatGPT 與 Codex　OpenAI 拿下最大企業部署案之一
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="description">
                                                企業級 AI 落地再下一城，OpenAI 在大型製造業者的滲透加速。
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">AI</a>
                                                <a href="#">半導體</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                         </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <div class="frameBox">
                    <div id="issue">
                        <div class="bg">
                            <div class="inBox">
                                <div class="txtBox">
                                    <div class="itemTitle">
                                        <p>最新科技情報</p>
                                        <p>TECH SIGNALS</p>
                                    </div>    
                                    <div class="title">
                                        <p>亞利桑那觀察 ———</p>
                                        <p class="big">矽沙漠崛起</p>
                                        <p>台灣的晶片，正在重塑一座美國沙漠城市。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="issueList">
                            <div class="inBox">
                                <p class="description">
                                    台積電落腳沙漠，不只帶來一座晶圓廠，而是帶動半導體供應鏈、造鎮開發、人才培育、台灣美食、航太科技與直航航班。
                                    TVBS 新聞網深度策展，帶你看懂一家台灣企業如何改變一座美國城市的命運。
                                </p>
                            
                                <div class="list">
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">Podcast</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                【2100TVBS看世界】台積電加碼3.3兆投資美國 還在亞利桑那蓋研發中心 川普暫停對烏克蘭所有軍援
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="300" src="/issue-image-01.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">專題報導</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                150 億美元交通藍圖背後：亞利桑那正打造下一個 30 年的產業走廊
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="169" src="/issue-image-02.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">專題報導</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                雙城故事：當台北遇上鳳凰城　AI 時代最重要的新科技走廊正形成
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="169" src="/issue-image-03.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">專題報導</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                台積電帶動「台灣嬰兒潮」 鳳凰城市長：已誕生 500 個寶寶
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="169" src="/issue-image-04.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">影片</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                【黃仁勳專訪】黃仁勳:別怕AI搶飯碗! 從汽車發明看AI社會共存 親自使用AI縮小科技落差 黃仁勳再談能源重要性…
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="169" src="/issue-image-05.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="item">
                                            <div class="tag">
                                                <a href="#">專題報導</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title">
                                                150 億美元交通藍圖背後：亞利桑那正打造下一個 30 年的產業走廊
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="img">
                                                <img width="300" height="169" src="/issue-image-06.jpg" alt="img" loading="lazy" />
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
        <footer></footer>
    </body>
</html>
